  "above_fold_text": "Search Careers Make a Gift MyChart Pay a Bill Translate English Spanish Arabic Nepali Vietnamese Bosnian French Portugese Swahili Services Providers Locations Patients & Visitors About Us Search Southern NH HealthMatch Choose an expert Primary Care Provider (PCP) near you who can help with: Preventive care and annual wellness visits Treatment for common illnesses and injuries Management of chronic conditions Seamless referrals to specialists for coordinated care Call Southern NH HealthMatch: 603-880-EASY (3279) Learn more",
  "visible_text": "Search\nSearch\nCareers Make a Gift MyChart Pay a Bill \nTranslate\nEnglish\nSpanish\nArabic\nNepali\nVietnamese\nBosnian\nFrench\nPortugese\nSwahili\nServicesProvidersLocationsPatients & VisitorsAbout Us \nSearch\nSouthern NH HealthMatch\n\nChoose an expert Primary Care Provider (PCP) near you who can help with:\n\nPreventive care and annual wellness visits\nTreatment for common illnesses and injuries\nManagement of chronic conditions\nSeamless referrals to specialists for coordinated care\n\nCall Southern NH HealthMatch: \n603-880-EASY (3279)\n\nLearn more\nImmediate Care\n\nTrusted, high-quality walk-in care for your non-emergency medical needs. Open seven days per week. We also offer virtual visits for your convenience. Call 603-577-2273 or schedule a virtual visit through SolutionHealth MyChart. \n\nLearn more\n\nSchedule an Appointment\n\nIf you already have a primary care provider, you can schedule an appointment through MyChart. \n\nSign in to MyChart\n\nFind a Provider\n\nSouthern NH HealthMatch makes it easy to find the Primary Care Provider who’s right for you based on your health needs, location, and preferences. Call our HealthMatch team at:\n603-880-3279\n\nAward Winning Care\n\nClick on the icons below to learn more about our awards and accreditations.\n\nCommitted. Connected. Patient-Focused Care.\n\nSouthern New Hampshire Health provides comprehensive, high quality, high value healthcare to communities in southern New Hampshire and northern Massachusetts. As a non-profit health system that has provided care for more than 130 years, we are dedicated to providing access to a wide range of care options for all.\n\nSouthern New Hampshire Medical Center, a 188-bed acute care facility located in the heart of downtown Nashua, has a medical staff of over 500 primary and specialty care providers from Foundation Medical Partners, Dartmouth-Hitchcock Nashua, and local independent practices.\n\nFoundation Medical Partners is a multi-specialty provider group, including more than 300 providers in primary, specialty and immediate care serving thousands of patients in more than 70 practices across southern New Hampshire and northern Massachusetts.\n\nTo deliver on our mission, we continue to innovate and support our skilled providers who bring the very best to our communities to help patients remain closer to home for their care.\n\nLearn More\n\nWays to Give \n\nSouthern New Hampshire Health is dedicated to strengthening healthcare across the greater Nashua area, recognizing that access to quality care enhances the health of individuals, families, and communities. We believe everyone deserves access to high-quality healthcare, especially those facing socioeconomic challenges. Philanthropic support through Legacy Trust enables us to expand essential community resources, creating a legacy of wellness and directly investing in the health and future of our community. \n \n\nHelp Us Build a Healthier Future\n\nImportant Information from Change Healthcare\n\nNews\nNews Announcements Health Care Topic Blog\n\nHow to Navigate the Holidays While on GLP-1 Weight Loss Drugs\n\nNOV 24, 2026\n\nNews Announcements Health Care Topic Blog\n\nNew Prostate Cancer Screening Guidelines\n\nNOV 23, 2026\n\nNews Announcements Health Care Topic Blog\n\nGet Checked for Prediabetes and Don’t Ignore the Results\n\nNOV 20, 2026\n\nHealth Care Topic Blog\n\nEasy Caprese Skewers\n\nNOV 20, 2026\n\nSee All News\n\nAbout SNHH\n\nAffiliations\nLeadership\nCareers\nNewsroom\nGift Shop\nCommunity Health\nPrice Transparency\nContact Us\nNotice of Privacy Practices\n\nFor Patients\n\nImmediate Care\nFind a Location\nFind a Provider\nBrowse All Services\nPay a Bill\nPrice Transparency & Cost Estimates\nMedical Records\nMyChart Patient Portal\nNon-Discrimination and Language Assistance\n\nFor Professionals\n\nMagnet-Designated Hospital\nPhysician Openings\nNurse Openings\nEmployee Benefits\nEmployee Login\n\nContribute\n\nVolunteer\nMake a Gift\n\n8 Prospect Street\n\nNashua, NH 03060\n\n603-577-2000\n\nThe contents of this website are for informational purposes only and are not a substitute for the medical care and advice of your provider.\nPrivacy Policy | Terms of Service | HIPAA | Accessibility | Price Transparency | © Southern New Hampshire Health 2026. All rights reserved.",
